[CENTER][B][SIZE="6"][COLOR="Red"]How to Unlocking the Bootloader LG L1 II[/COLOR][/SIZE][/B]
[COLOR="Magenta"][B][B]E410/11/15[/B][/B][/COLOR]

[IMG]http://img.androidsis.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/desbloquear-el-bootloader-de-lg-oficialmente-1.jpg[/IMG][/CENTER]

Requirements:
[LIST]
[*]LG L1 II rooted (How to Root [URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/general/guide-how-to-root-lg-l1-ii-e410-11-15-t3240380"]here[/URL])
[*]Terminal Emulator
[*]bootloader-L1 [URL="http://xdaforums.com/attachment.php?attachmentid=3529985&stc=1&d=1446589882"]here[/URL]
[/LIST]

steps:
[LIST]
[*]Download the bootloader-L1 ( link above)
[*]Unpack "bootloader-L1" in "internal memory" (/sdcard)
[*]Open the terminal and run these commands
[LIST=1]
[*]su
[*]cd sdcard
[*]sh unlock.sh
[/list]
[*]Done ;) Bootloader Unlocked
[/LIST]

[/LIST]